  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.3.0 detects a client of another on-disk protocol version instead of letting it corrupt the work folder. No breaking changes.\n\n- Clients that share a work folder need the same protocol version, not the same library version. This release is protocol 1.\n- New: IncompatibleClientException. The write operations and RecoverAsync wait within their lock wait, then throw it while a client of another protocol version uses the work folder. Detection works on Windows only.\n- Journals record their protocol version. RecoverAsync reports a journal of another protocol version as JournalUnreadable and does not touch it.\n- 0.2.0 clients can share a work folder with 0.3.0, but cannot be detected.\n- Before upgrading the clients of a work folder, call RecoverAsync with the old version.\n\nFull notes: https://github.com/YUKIKEDA/Txfio/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
